<title>USA: CompuServe names Edward Lucente to board.</title>
<headline>CompuServe names Edward Lucente to board.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompuServe Corp said Wednesday that Edward Lucente has been elected to its board of directors.</p>
<p>Lucente is the interim presient and chief executive of Liant Software Corp in Framingham, Mass.  </p>
<p>Lucente's position on the board is a newly created one, increasing the size of CompuServe's board to six spots from five, a spokeswoman said.</p>
